caseStudy:
  problem: "Small barbershops often take bookings by phone and DM, and their prices live in an old Facebook post. Customers can't see what a cut costs or when there's a free chair."
  built: "A fast, dark-themed site with a clear services and prices page, a step-by-step booking flow (service, barber, time) and pages for the team and opening hours. Prices and services sit in Keystatic, so they can be edited in a simple admin screen. The booking is a working front-end demo and doesn't take real appointments."
